<title>BELGIUM: Tessenderlo says 1996 net down 17.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Tessenderlo says 1996 net down 17.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			 51.413   vs   47.811</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profits		 3.694   vs    3.841</p>
<p>    Net profits		     2.567   vs    3.101</p>
<p>    Cash flow			 6.013   vs    7.184</p>
<p>    Net nominal dividend	  250 bfr	 240 bfr</p>
<p>NOTE - Tessenderlo is a Belgian chemicals and plastics producer</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
